# SmartCura - Git Ignore File

# ============================================
# DOCUMENTATION & MARKDOWN (Excluded for now)
# ============================================

# Exclude all documentation folders.
# Note: "docs/*" (children) rather than "docs/" (the directory itself), because git
# cannot re-include anything inside an excluded directory. The exception at the end
# of this section depends on that.
docs/*
docs_backup*/
*/docs/
*/*/docs/

# Design assets: keep the guides, exclude the bulky generated mockups
design/html_mockups/
design/stitch_splash/
design/**/*.zip

# System cleanup scripts (not part of the project build)
tools/system_cleanup/

# Exclude all markdown files except essential ones in root
/*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!ENVIRONMENT.md
# The agent working file: next actions, conventions and traps. See its own header.
!AGENTS.md
# Test user credentials — contains Firebase API key, kept local only
TEST_USERS.md

# Allow README.md in subdirectories (for app folders)
!apps/*/README.md
!apps/*/**/README.md
!iot-firmware/README.md
!iot-firmware/**/README.md

# Exclude specific internal markdown files (if they get created)
START_HERE.md
INITIAL_PUSH_GUIDE.md
GITHUB_PUSH_COMPLETE.md
DOCTOR_APP_UI_COMPLETION_STATUS.md
DRIVER_APP_UI_COMPLETION_STATUS.md
PATIENT_APP_UI_COMPLETION_STATUS.md
WEB_PORTAL_UI_COMPLETION_STATUS.md
GITHUB_REPOSITORY_STRATEGY_ANALYSIS.md
SUBMISSION_GUIDE.md
READY_TO_PUSH.md
PUSH_TO_GITHUB.md
FUTURE_WORK.md
VERSIONING.md
*_COMPLETION_STATUS.md
*_ANALYSIS.md
*_GUIDE.md
*_SUMMARY.md

# Exception, and it must stay last in this section so it wins over the patterns above:
# authoritative technical specs and backend contract/design records must be reviewable
# in the repository.
!docs/04_TECHNICAL_SPECIFICATIONS/
!docs/04_TECHNICAL_SPECIFICATIONS/**

# The three documents the design of record actually points readers at. Without these the
# repository ships a README linking to files that are not in it, and a fresh contributor
# cannot see the per-gate status or the measured figures at all.
!docs/QUICK_REFERENCE.md
!docs/README.md
# Generated by `node tools/status.mjs`, and committed on purpose: a status file nobody can
# read is not a status file. Never hand-edit it.
!docs/STATUS.md
# Mobile-app audit reports and fix plans: authoritative FYP readiness snapshots.
!docs/audit/
!docs/audit/**
# Project roadmap: ESP32 → Health Connect → unified health data → AI.
!docs/ROADMAP.md
# Approved AI architecture master plan — referenced by the implementation phases.
!docs/AI_MASTER_PLAN.md
!apps/api/docs/
!apps/api/docs/**

# Keep these specific files
!LICENSE
!VERSION

